Package: condagree
Type: Package
Title: Ability-Conditioned Inter-Rater Agreement for Constructed-Response Items
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Azmi", "Fitrisia", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4230-4921")),
    person("Tri Zahra", "Ningsih", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "trizahra.2023@student.uny.ac.id",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2544-9627")),
    person("Suci Kurnia", "Putri", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-8021-148X")))
Description: Estimates inter-rater agreement for double-scored constructed-response
    items as a function of examinee ability rather than as a single global
    index. Provides kernel- and band-conditional exact agreement and
    item-stratified Cohen's kappa (Cohen, 1960) <doi:10.1177/001316446002000104>,
    school-cluster bootstrap confidence bands, a uniformity test that separates
    the score-opportunity effect (partial-credit categories are harder to score)
    from a residual ability effect, a test of directional rater severity, and
    pooling over plausible values with Rubin's rules and the D1 statistic of
    Li, Raghunathan and Rubin (1991) <doi:10.1080/01621459.1991.10475152>.
    A data generator supports simulation studies.
